<title>UK: Argentina sets 500 mln peso five year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 500 mln peso five year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN PESO  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD **+240-245 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BBB-	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 250	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT JUN 2002 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	UBS IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
